<title>JAPAN: FP Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>FP Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 36.23		vs	   35.33</p>
<p> Operating	    1.15		vs	  932    million</p>
<p> Current		1.21		vs	  946    million</p>
<p> Net		  726    million	  vs	  423    million</p>
<p> EPS		   35.86 yen	  vs	   20.91 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     20 million	  vs	  20 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  9.00 yen	  vs	    8.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - FP Corp is a leading manufacturer of polystyrene and other synthetic resin foodware.</p>
</text>
